# One plain line for each workplace type card: what it makes and the bench it needs
aetherhaven.workplace.line.smelting = Smelts ore into bars. Needs a Furnace.
aetherhaven.workplace.line.blacksmithing = Forges weapons and tools. Needs a Blacksmith's Anvil.
aetherhaven.workplace.line.armorCrafting = Makes armor and guard kits. Needs an Armorer's Workbench.
aetherhaven.workplace.line.ranching = Tends animals for food support. Needs a Feeding Trough.
aetherhaven.workplace.line.farming = Tends crops for food support. Needs a Farmer's Workbench.
aetherhaven.workplace.line.mycology = Grows mushrooms. Needs Mushroom Logs.
aetherhaven.workplace.line.berries = Picks berries from bushes. Needs a Farmer's Workbench.
aetherhaven.workplace.line.mining = Digs tunnels for ore and stone. Needs a Workbench.
aetherhaven.workplace.line.building = Builds your town's projects. Needs a Builder's Workbench.
aetherhaven.workplace.line.blockWorkshop = Cuts building blocks to order. Needs a Builder's Workbench.
aetherhaven.workplace.line.alchemy = Brews potions. Needs an Alchemist's Workbench.
aetherhaven.workplace.line.crafting = Makes supplies and tools. Needs a Workbench.
aetherhaven.workplace.line.leatherworking = Tans hides into leather goods. Needs a Tanning Rack.
aetherhaven.workplace.line.cooking = Cooks food to order. Needs a Chef's Stove.
aetherhaven.workplace.line.jewelry = Crafts rings and necklaces. Needs a Jewelry Crafting Bench.
aetherhaven.workplace.line.salvaging = Breaks old gear into materials. Needs a Salvager's Workbench.

